- * @next: the &drm_gpuva to remap when keeping the end of a mapping
- * @op: the &drm_gpuva_op_remap to initialize @prev and @next with
- *
- * Removes the currently mapped &drm_gpuva and remaps it using @prev and/or
- * @next.
