-	 * Write access.  For files, this maps onto:
-	 *	FILE_APPEND_DATA | FILE_WRITE_ATTRIBUTES | FILE_WRITE_DATA |
-	 *	FILE_WRITE_EA | STANDARD_RIGHTS_WRITE | SYNCHRONIZE
